                "description": "The Arts and Crafts 8 Inch Door Handle exhibits the relaxed charm of southwestern decor. The hammered design is great for adding a point of intrest to this rustic door pull, giving it that on the ranch feel that is so popular. The 8 Inch Hammered Arts and Crafts Pull is available in 4 finish colors. It will fit doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick and comes packaged with everything you'll need to thru-bolt mount it to your front door.",
